---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure & Transparency Policy | TechPulse"
  description="Full FTC-compliant Affiliate Disclosure explaining our monetization policies, referral links, and testing independence."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: October 5, 2026</p>

      <p>
        In compliance with the Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines, please assume that any and all links on <strong>TechPulse</strong> (<code>https://techpulse.dev</code>) that lead to third-party software, tools, services, or products are affiliate links.
      </p>

      <h2>What Is an Affiliate Link?</h2>
      <p>
        An affiliate link contains a unique tracking tracking code. When you click an affiliate link on TechPulse and subsequently complete a purchase or subscribe to a service, we may receive a monetary commission from the merchant or platform provider.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Important:</strong> Clicking an affiliate link will <em>never</em> cost you any extra money. In fact, many of our affiliate relationships allow us to negotiate exclusive reader discounts, extended free trials, or bonus developer credits (e.g. cloud hosting credits).
      </p>

      <h2>Amazon Associates Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        TechPulse is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial Standards & Objectivity</h2>
      <p>
        Our financial relationships with affiliate partners do not dictate or influence our editorial integrity or opinions:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>We only recommend tools, frameworks, and developer services that our team has tested, vetted, or actively uses in engineering production.</li>
        <li>We clearly outline both the <strong>Pros</strong> and <strong>Cons</strong> of every piece of software we benchmark.</li>
        <li>If a tool is buggy, over-priced, or under-delivers, we say so plainly regardless of whether an affiliate program exists.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions regarding our affiliate relationships or would like clarification on a specific link, please feel free to contact our editorial desk via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
